16. use of any prescription medications and/or products within 14 days prior to Check-in (Day -1) of Period 1 and during the entire study;
17. use of any over-the-counter, non-prescription medications, vitamins, or minerals within 7 days prior to Check-in (Day -1) of Period 1 and during the entire study;
18. use of phytotherapeutic/herbal/plant-derived preparations within 7 days prior to Check-in (Day -1) of Period 1 and during the entire study;
