1. Assess respiratory risk in surgical patients in Catalonia (ARRSPC) ≥45 points;
2. BMI≥30;
3. Moderate to severe asthma;
4. Moderate to severe chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD);
5. Smoking history ≥20 packs/year

Exclusion Criteria:

