2. trastuzumab based adjuvant/neoadjuvant therapy;
3. treatment with any other anticancer therapy (lapatinib, immunotherapy, etc);
4. patients with heart failure, coronary artery disease or myocardial infarction within the previous 6 months.
5. trastuzumab based first line therapy started beyond 4 weeks from the first diagnoses of AGC.

